${color white}${fs_bar 3,300 /home}
${voffset 6}${color}${font PizzaDude Bullets:size=12}S${font}  ${color white}Загружено ${color }${totaldown wlp2s0}
${voffset 1}${color}${font PizzaDude Bullets:size=12}r${font}  ${color white}Вход: ${color } ${downspeed wlp2s0}/s ${alignr}${downspeedgraph wlp2s0 10,130 FFFFFF FFFFFF}

${color}${font PizzaDude Bullets:size=12}M${font}  ${color white}Отправлено ${color }${totalup wlp2s0}
${voffset 1}${color}${font PizzaDude Bullets:size=12}v${font}  ${color white}Исход: ${color }${upspeed wlp2s0} /s ${alignr}${upspeedgraph wlp2s0 10,130 FFFFFF FFFFFF}
